; RUN: dgtl-opt --pass=dce --filecheck %s
; FileCheck test for Dead Code Elimination (DCE) pass
;
; Verifies that DCE removes unreachable instructions while preserving
; essential control flow and data dependencies.

; CHECK-LABEL: Stream size
; CHECK-DAG: opcode
; CHECK-DAG: result
; CHECK-NOT: ERROR
; CHECK: success
